    <briefdescription>
<para>Represents a sparse matrix storing ingredient-recipe relationships. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Represents a sparse matrix linking recipes and ingredients.</para>
<para>Implemented as a linked list of <ref refid="struct_matrix_entry" kindref="compound">MatrixEntry</ref> nodes.</para>
<para>Each non-zero cell is represented as a <ref refid="struct_matrix_entry" kindref="compound">MatrixEntry</ref> node. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
